    "notes": "The fed's own largest surviving document: a 35-match Battle Bowl elimination tournament, wrestled preliminary-round tag/singles matches (eight of them WCOTW title matches) into a 26-man Battle Bowl battle royal. Two titles changed hands on the card (European: Saturn over Warrior; Television: Brett Clark over Casper in an Inferno Match) and a third's own change is billed but not explicitly confirmed as a title change in the source's own language (World Heavyweight: Buff over Undertaker — see the title's own epitaph). The tournament's own final fall: Mystik eliminates Goldberg with a running lariat to win the Battle Bowl in 35 minutes 25 seconds.",
